    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.fuzzy\n\n### Description\n\nWould it be possible for mini.fuzzy to mock ,https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope-fzf-native.nvim in a similar way to `MiniIcons.mock_nvim_web_devicons = function()` ?\n\nThis would allow us to use dropbar.nvim without having to install telescope-fzf-native.nvim",
