    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\n'mini.fuzzy' is somewhat retired. Originally its main goal indeed was to provide a faster matching for 'telescope.nvim'. But since there is now 'mini.pick' with its own fast default matching *and* there is built-in `vim.fn.matchfuzzy()`, this is a bit obsolete.\n\nSo I am afraid this is out of scope for 'mini.fuzzy' (and 'mini.nvim', for that matter).",
